Package: encodeUtils
Type: Package
Title: Query and Retrieve ENCODE Portal Metadata and Files
Version: 0.99.14
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Zoheb",
    family = "Khan",
    email = "zohebkhan600@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0266-8886")
    )
Description: Queries the ENCODE Portal REST API and converts nested metadata
    into traceable experiment and file tables. Provides accession-aware search,
    file selection, download planning and verification, and local-file reading
    workflows. Records request, file, and attribution metadata for reproducible
    downstream R and Bioconductor analyses.
